# UI design system

Match the job board (`/`) and outreach board (`/outreach`). Tokens live in `web/src/styles.css` `:root`.

## Tokens

- Colors: `--ink`, `--muted`, `--surface`, `--panel`, `--line`, `--accent: #0f6e56`, `--accent-soft`, `--warn*`, `--danger*`
- Fonts: Fraunces (`--font-display`) for titles/brand; DM Sans (`--font-ui`) for body/controls
- Radius: `--radius` (12px); buttons/inputs often 10px; pills `999px`

## Vocabulary

Reuse existing classes — do not invent parallel systems:

- Layout: `.app-shell`, `.page-head`, `.panel`, `.detail-grid`
- Actions: `.btn`, `.btn-primary`, `.btn-ghost`, `.btn-danger`
- Forms: `.field`, `.form-grid`, `.section`, `.checkbox-row`
- Chips: `ContactRouteChip`, `DemoChip`, `.badge`

## Do

- Prefer CSS classes over inline styles
- One primary CTA per view (`btn-primary`); secondary actions as ghosts
- Keep cool gray + teal — no purple gradients, cream+terracotta, glow, or dark-mode defaults

## Don't

- Do not add Tailwind or shadcn unless explicitly requested
- Do not introduce a second font stack or accent color
